*Aufbau Principle:* Orbitals are filled in order of increasing energy ($1s, 2s, 2p, 3s, 3p, 4s, 3d, dots$). However, electron-electron interactions can lead to energetic anomalies, particularly when half-filling or fully-filling a subshell offers additional stability.
